<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 909)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The manual&#8217;s PDF, done properly.</b> Autonomy on the cover, the mark on every page; chapters numbered as the manual numbers them (9, 9.1, 9.2); an <b>index by topic</b> &#8212; Resolve, Kitsu, Suite, Google Drive, Compare, Loops, Voice notes and sixty more &#8212; each listing the sections that cover it with chapter and page, every line a link; and no more runaway blue bold text (a placeholder in the prose had been read as a tag).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
