<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 906)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Delivery progress, in both windows.</b> Share This Review&#8217;s Media row and Source Links&#8217; &#8220;What Asobi knows&#8221; show the same live line &#8212; checking, copying or uploading with a spinner, then the outcome, which stays on screen for the session.</li>
<li><b>Source Links says the source in words</b> when it isn&#8217;t a link &#8212; &#8220;from the delivery to Google Drive (invited people only) &#8212; they download it and drop it on the window&#8221; &#8212; with <b>Type a link instead</b>; <b>Use What Asobi Knows</b> is a real button now and reports what it applied.</li>
<li>The Review Manager&#8217;s list no longer keeps a green &#8220;live&#8221; dot on a review that has ended.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
